 online harassment and violence. The proliferation of AI-enabled tools is making it worse.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>South Korea: Bus hits 32 vehicles near Seoul, dozens injured</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bce25d3f7ba91b5c35f3b7bd4b46cecfd85459fd0b5271044f39760901ff3a46</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:48:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T04:17:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/south-korea-bus-hits-32-vehicles-near-seoul-dozens-injured/a-79914074--cfc6bcb0a119.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/south-korea-bus-hits-32-vehicles-near-seoul-dozens-injured/a-79914074?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The bus plowed into over 30 vehicles, including other buses, during rush hour traffic in the South Korean city of Seongnam, just south of Seoul.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Israel: Eisenkot proposes October 7 probe as new Knesset sworn in</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:be2134f740b87db4b43c04c050085fd653dd6993eddd91a081f7b1c283998d69</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:48:58Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T03:33:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/israel-eisenkot-proposes-october-7-probe-as-new-knesset-sworn-in/a-79913636--01a688ec8f46.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/israel-eisenkot-proposes-october-7-probe-as-new-knesset-sworn-in/a-79913636?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Ex-IDF chief Gadi Eisenkot has yet to forge a coalition that would allow him to replace Benjamin Netanyahu, despite the new Knesset being dominated by the critics of the current prime minister.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US Republicans derail push to impeach Defense Secretary Pete Hegseth</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a79f36273fb03f175bf5b4ba0e223f7c845d743214eb9df9ad6f2505deab051a</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:49:01Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T02:04:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-republicans-derail-push-to-impeach-defense-secretary-pete-hegseth/a-79913761--b41bf186f55b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-republicans-derail-push-to-impeach-defense-secretary-pete-hegseth/a-79913761?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Pentagon chief Pete Hegseth seems set to survive the impeachment bid launched by maverick Republican lawmaker Thomas Massie, with President Donald Trump praising the outcome of the vote.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US charges 3 alleged Iranian operatives over plots targeting Jewish communities and a UK airbase</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:16c831a314a7f4b230a926096aa9c8df36a22f035a1d9fc314845aa85d3f05bd</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:49:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T23:18:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-charges-3-alleged-iranian-operatives-over-plots-targeting-jewish-communities-and-a-uk-airbase/a-79913543--477a23bfa03f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-charges-3-alleged-iranian-operatives-over-plots-targeting-jewish-communities-and-a-uk-airbase/a-79913543?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">US prosecutors claim the three men were planning a "campaign of terror" against Jewish communities and a UK airbase. The Fairford incident prompted the US to pull out its bombers used for operations against Iran.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Former Malaysian leader Najib Razak returns home under royal pardon, but faces a separate 15-year prison sentence</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5214ee4476ce68aef76f8b0e6c8db34ce5bad0400feb1146b35de4681ad4439e</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:49:07Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T20:39:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/former-malaysian-leader-najib-razak-returns-home-under-royal-pardon-but-faces-a-separate-15-year-pri/a-79913437--5df11bf7bdda.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/former-malaysian-leader-najib-razak-returns-home-under-royal-pardon-but-faces-a-separate-15-year-prison-sentence/a-79913437?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Najib Razak has left prison under a royal pardon, prompting a minister to resign in protest. Malaysia's former leader still faces a separate 15-year sentence over the corruption scandal that brought him down.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>British counterterrorism police arrest US soldier accused of spying on behalf of Russia</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e34e87e03d2396d7ebd7b9ee5f05fbfa2a4a4721f00292b92ba8160de657ce5f</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:49:10Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T19:35:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/british-counterterrorism-police-arrest-us-soldier-accused-of-spying-on-behalf-of-russia/a-79913240--5991e0a904a3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/british-counterterrorism-police-arrest-us-soldier-accused-of-spying-on-behalf-of-russia/a-79913240?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A member of the US Army has been arrested near Gloucester in England. Police said he was suspected of espionage activity in connection with Russia. Investigators from the US and UK are involved in the probe.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>UK Privy Council overrules Trinidad and Tobago gay sex law</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:073deb32489d8f7037d7e47431fc7abfa7cce6809f57c36e5c82a43098a50e6c</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:49:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T19:21:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/uk-privy-council-overrules-trinidad-and-tobago-gay-sex-law/a-79912163--f186aba38925.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/uk-privy-council-overrules-trinidad-and-tobago-gay-sex-law/a-79912163?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A London court has overturned a Trinidad and Tobago law criminalizing consensual sexual relations between male same-sex couples. As a result of the colonial legacy, it is the independent country's last court of appeal.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Victims of Nazi war in Poland call on Germany for support</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:56c83040dd8b83a835f0eb4ddb8c5402eeb497b150f9328baa15766b5770f054</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:49:16Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T17:53:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/victims-of-nazi-war-in-poland-call-on-germany-for-support/a-79909311--36756d6320e4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/victims-of-nazi-war-in-poland-call-on-germany-for-support/a-79909311?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">More than 80 years after the end of World War II, Polish victims of the Nazi regime are still waiting for a "humanitarian gesture" from Germany. The 2027 draft budget hasn't left them much hope for possible reparations.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Iran denies role in fridge hack, France summons ambassador</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7f0b7157961f9df8738e6877693f6503b7e5d33f05517283a88e4a751ff8bb8d</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:51Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T15:57:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/iran-denies-role-in-fridge-hack-france-summons-ambassador/a-79910206--6d0355211a72.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/iran-denies-role-in-fridge-hack-france-summons-ambassador/a-79910206?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">France has said it rules "nothing" out in response to a cyberattack on supermarket refrigeration units. Iran, however, said it categorically rejected Paris' "baseless and one-sided accusations" of IRGC involvement.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Controversial kinship: From colonial rule to the Holocaust?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d66706e0d7992fcce95d329aea1ba4df6cab038eee8276591c68865ac78cf405</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:51Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T15:49:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/controversial-kinship-from-colonial-rule-to-the-holocaust/a-79902228--16129c6452e2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/controversial-kinship-from-colonial-rule-to-the-holocaust/a-79902228?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Hitler once called Eastern Europe "Germany's India." A new exhibition examines the links between colonialism and Nazism, and the bitter debate over where comparisons illuminate history and where they fall short.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Poland: Krakow shooting suspect 'fascinated' by Norwegian mass murder Anders Breivik, says justice minister</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:283f719bf222540d542da8f09237570ddf1b296f857f61a360331cb77df3c138</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:51Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T15:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/poland-krakow-shooting-suspect-fascinated-by-norwegian-mass-murder-anders-breivik-says-justice-minis/a-79910435--6c31a3e79cc8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/poland-krakow-shooting-suspect-fascinated-by-norwegian-mass-murder-anders-breivik-says-justice-minister/a-79910435?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The 24-year old suspect was found to have read a significant amount of material about Breivik and other far-right figures. Speculation over his motives have prompted a bitter political feud in Warsaw.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Neuer injury gives Urbig chance to shape Bayern and Germany future</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b2d0c9f8e91c82f05c41727cca88ac17cd93e15fcbd9b47da049ec7b1d9a31d3</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:51Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T15:13:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/neuer-injury-gives-urbig-chance-to-shape-bayern-and-germany-future/a-79910042--b0a77bac4246.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/neuer-injury-gives-urbig-chance-to-shape-bayern-and-germany-future/a-79910042?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Manuel Neuer's latest injury gives Jonas Urbig a run of games in Bayern's goal. Marc-André ter Stegen remains Germany’s No. 1, but Urbig now has a chance to strengthen his case for the future.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Megaspeed and the battle to go high-end Nvidia chips into China</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:661f9ffb42e3cda65c6cccb39ccc938e8a773c78a09ecfaf6d367255263f1bbc</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:51Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T14:32:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/megaspeed-and-the-battle-to-go-high-end-nvidia-chips-into-china/a-79909129--5e400fbb45fc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/megaspeed-and-the-battle-to-go-high-end-nvidia-chips-into-china/a-79909129?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Jensen Huang's affair with a suspected Chinese spy has shone a light on Megaspeed, the company she worked for. It is under investigation in the US for smuggling Nvidia chips into China, which it denies.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Pope Leo vs. Javier Milei: How political is the pope?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a78834c8fdbe06d98ef286c94da3f61c3da46e9e9682682d1e20a3495e32f91f</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:51Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T13:47:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/pope-leo-vs-javier-milei-how-political-is-the-pope/a-79907666--31a87b963c2b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/pope-leo-vs-javier-milei-how-political-is-the-pope/a-79907666?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Pope Leo XIV's tour of South America has drawn huge crowds — and a measure of political controversy. Perceived criticism of Argentina's leader, and earlier rebukes of Donald Trump, offer a glimpse into papacy politics.</summary><category term="TOP STORIES" /></entry><entry><title>Japan watches for signs of change in Trump's foreign policy priorities</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f8e6ecc969759c06eff7afe98c64c8e65f9a45cf79ed848c8804a3f8fa261dd9</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:51Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T13:31:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/japan-watches-for-signs-of-change-in-trump-s-foreign-policy-priorities/a-79909398--c0dcb3ef3493.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/japan-watches-for-signs-of-change-in-trump-s-foreign-policy-priorities/a-79909398?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Tokyo fears the drubbing US President Donald Trump suffered in last week's midterm election may push him to pursue a diplomatic quick win at the expense of Washington's allies in the Indo-Pacific.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Bulgaria highway pileup kills 12, dozens injured: PM</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:325ab43f228c67d5c7d487dcdcd0a49779b5912a9b47cd3e0a7c429c3dcdd8f2</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:47:51Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T11:57:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/bulgaria-highway-pileup-kills-12-dozens-injured-pm/a-79907978--e4c51329b4c8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/bulgaria-highway-pileup-kills-12-dozens-injured-pm/a-79907978?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">At least 12 people were killed and dozens injured in a series of crashes caused by thick fog in Bulgaria. Police, firefighters and paramedics were dispatched to the scene for the rescue operation.</summary><cat